      "message": "refactor(ui): split panes.rs into ribbon, mode tabs and status files\n\nMove the ribbon command table, its gates, its command path, its layout\nmath, the machine-mode tabs, the section door dropdown, the ribbon strip\nand the status strip into crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes/. panes.rs keeps\nthe keyboard layer and re-exports the old names. No behaviour change.\n\nFixes #4393\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
